<div class="set panel">
  <h3>Version</h3>
  <p class="hint">The launcher checks for a newer hub every time you start it, installs it before the
    window opens, and steps aside. There is nothing to update from in here.</p>

  <div class="field">
    <label>Hub</label>
    <div class="val"><span class="note"><%= version %></span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="field">
    <label>Build</label>
    <div class="val">
      <span class="note"><%= build or "running from a source tree" %></span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <% if not installed then %>
    <p class="hint">This hub is running from a checkout, so the launcher is not involved and the
      files on disk are already the ones you are editing.</p>
  <% end %>
</div>
